    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the way you put it... \"letting the curtain fall\"... that's the only thing that's actually sounded good in a long time. even the idea of just silence. everything else is just so loud and taxing. if the performance is what's causing all the pain, then isn't the most logical way to find peace to just end the performance entirely? to just reach that silence you're talking about?",
